# Agora — MCP Service Hub

**API Gateway for AI Agents.** Discover, monitor, and orchestrate all your MCP services from one place.

## What it does
- 🔍 Auto-discovers MCP services in your workspace
- 🫀 Health checks with circuit breaker (CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN)
- 🚀 Pipeline orchestration (sequential/parallel/streaming)
- 📡 Event bus with publish/subscribe
- 🛒 MCP Tool Marketplace (20+ built-in services)
- 📊 Web Dashboard + Prometheus metrics

## Quick Install
```bash
pip install agora-mcp
agora discover
agora web
```

## MCP Tools (9)
`register_service` · `list_services` · `check_health` · `add_route` · `list_routes` · `route_call` · `publish_event` · `subscribe_event` · `get_event_log`

